
# Smart Study Planner

## Problem Statement
Students often have multiple subjects, topics, and deadlines to manage. It can be difficult to remember all study tasks and track their completion. This project provides a simple way to organize and track study tasks using Python.

## Scope
The project allows users to:
- Add study tasks
- View tasks
- Complete tasks
- Delete tasks
- Check study progress
- View high-priority pending tasks

## Target Users
- School and college students
- Students learning basic Python

## High-Level Features
- Task management using Python
- Subject, topic, priority, and deadline tracking
- Completed/Pending status
- Study progress percentage
- High-priority task filtering
- Simple terminal-based interface

## Technology Used
- Python
- Lists and Dictionaries
- Functions
- Git/GitHub
